  <metadata_license>MIT</metadata_license>
  <project_license>MIT</project_license>

  <name>Frameguin</name>
  <summary>Hardware controls for Framework laptops</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      Settings are changed from the application window, or from a tray menu
      that needs no window open.
    </p>
    <p>
      Controls appear only for the hardware the board reports. Changing a
      setting is authorized through polkit; on non-Framework hardware the app
      opens and reports that it found none.
    </p>
  </description>

